    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which is better for voiceovers, ElevenLabs or Murf?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "ElevenLabs is stronger for voice cloning and developer APIs — its Professional Voice Cloning is available from the Creator plan and it supports 74 languages. Murf AI is stronger for studio-style voiceovers with a slide-based editor and 200+ voices, and its entry plan is $19/month versus ElevenLabs Starter at $6/month. For narration where voice similarity to a real person matters, ElevenLabs is the usual choice; for business explainer videos built by non-technical teams, Murf is easier."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does Speechify cost?",
