      "name": "Do these tools let me clone my own voice?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "ElevenLabs offers Instant Voice Cloning from the Starter plan and Professional Voice Cloning from Creator, with voice slots scaling up to 2,200 on the Business plan. Murf focuses on a curated library of 200+ licensed voices rather than self-serve cloning. Speechify is built for listening to existing text, not for producing cloned voiceovers."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which tool has the lowest starting price?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "ElevenLabs has the lowest paid entry point at $6/month for Starter, which includes a commercial license and instant voice cloning. Murf starts at $19/month and Speechify at $29/month billed monthly, or about $11.58/month if paid annually."
      }
    }
  ]
